pan>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà jiû-liōng bo-hò mài-ka-goà chòng-khâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kân jit-kâng jit-kâng jit-kâng lêh-jàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>汗<rt>괄ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一滴<rt>짇딯</rt></ruby> <ruby>一滴<rt>짇딯</rt></ruby> <ruby>一滴<rt>짇딯</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>流<rt>ᄅᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koā̰ jit-tih jit-tih jit-tih lêh-láu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>老<rt>ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-jit-kâng làn lông-lāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>𤆬<rt>촤-</rt></ruby><ruby>𡚸<rt>뻐ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>囝<rt>걀ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>鬥陣<rt>ᄃᅷˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    choa-bôr-kià̰ tàu-tīn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>浪子<rt>렁주ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>回頭<rt>훼ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    long-jù hue-tháu\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親愛<rt>친ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>可愛<rt>코ˆ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>緣投<rt>옌ᄃᅷˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-ai’e khô-ai’e yen-táu’e pieng-yù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>糞掃<rt>분ˋ소</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>品<rt>핀ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>路用<rt>러영ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\